      "coverage_note": "`Routing.RegisterRoute(nameof(DetailsPage), typeof(DetailsPage))` -- the spelling the .NET MAUI docs and the Visual Studio item template use. The route name is a `nameof` expression rather than a literal, so the route itself is not stated; which page AppShell registers is."
